	"data": "<!-- scanner: tagged active/ongoing but not updated in 79d — review -->\n\nRoom 2.0 — AR Contextual Interfaces\n\n\"Forget any amount of mixed reality. Go just full and hard on pure augmented reality.\" — cithoreal, May 2026\n\nVision\n\nPure AR system using Quest 3 to create contextual interfaces anchored to physical devices and locations in your home. Walk up to a Raspberry Pi, see its context menu. Pull up a terminal. Check network stats on Star. The room becomes an interface — not a place you happen…",
